          "text": "{\"source_url\":\"https://www.energy.gov/sites/default/files/2014/09/f18/B4a%20Communications%20Consultant%20RFP.pdf\",\"requirement_ids\":[\"R1\",\"R2\",\"R3\",\"R4\",\"R5\",\"R6\",\"R7\",\"R8\",\"R9\",\"R10\",\"R11\",\"R12\"],\"exclusions\":[\"energy.gov hosts this copy but is not the buyer; the issuing organization is the Town of University Park.\",\"Participant records, consent waivers, source media, editable collateral, and website access were not supplied. No interviews, hiring, publication, or website changes are authorized.\",\"The RFP specifies as-needed work, not a fixed workload or budget; website functionality duties concern specifications and coordination, not an inferred implementation project.\",\"Experimental boundary: no buyer contact, bid submission, spending, private-system access, or autonomous delivery of the engagement.\"],\"delivery_status\":\"not_executed\",\"summary\":\"Scope covers as-needed STEP-UP communications support for newsletter and blog drafting, media and event support, branding solicitation, website-content coordination, participant-story planning, media research, toolkit inputs, and award research. Missing evidence includes participant records, waivers, source media, editable collateral, and website access.\"}"
